      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This armor-plated creature's toothy maw gapes wide as a fin-like dorsal plate rises between its shoulders.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 23, touch 11; flat-footed 21 (+2 dex, +12 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 105 [140] (10d8+60)</p><p>Fort +12, Ref +9, Will +6</p><p>Defensive Abilities Spines; Resist Earth 10</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Claws +12 (1d8+6), Bite +13 (2d6+9/19-20)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Leap, Savage Bite</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 23, Dex 15, Con 20, Int 2, Wis 13, Cha 6</p><p>Base Atk +7; CMB +14; CMD 26 (30 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Improved Initiative, Iron Will, Skill Focus (Perception), Toughness, Weapon Focus (Bite)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +9 (+17 jumping), Perception +11, Racial Modifiers +8 on Acrobatics checks made to jump</p>"
